studio-1810c (1.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Level meters for every input strip and output pair, computed from the audio
    stream through PipeWire (the device reports no levels - see PROTOCOL.md).
  * Poll the state packet at 2 Hz instead of faster: the device stalls 0xA1 with
    EPIPE above roughly 4 Hz while streaming.
  * Reconnect to the interface if it is plugged in after the window opened.

 -- Studio 1810c for Linux <studio-1810c@users.noreply.github.com>  Fri, 27 Nov 2026 14:30:00 +0100

studio-1810c (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First release.
  * Vendor USB protocol implemented from the macOS Universal Control 5.1.1
    binaries: 18x10 routing matrix, output faders, front-panel switches,
    clock status.
  * GTK3 + WebKit2 desktop window following the Universal Control layout.
  * udev rule shipped by the package, so no manual permission step.

 -- Studio 1810c for Linux <studio-1810c@users.noreply.github.com>  Fri, 27 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0100
